        "text": "theorem timeDerivative_coverMap {f : Plane → ℂ} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (n : ℕ) (z : Plane) : timeDerivative (fun x => f (coverMap n x)) z = ChartScales.Tg ^ n • timeDerivative f (coverMap n z)"
